# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore: the context is the workspace root; the image
# needs the bench tree, hud-python, and the Arena checkout (minus its heavy
# dev submodules — Isaac Lab itself IS needed).
*
!assembly_bench
!hud-python
!env/IsaacLab-Arena
assembly_bench/submodules
assembly_bench/eval
assembly_bench/notes
env/IsaacLab-Arena/submodules/Isaac-GR00T
env/IsaacLab-Arena/docs
**/__pycache__
**/.git
**/.venv
hud-python/docs
